s/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stderr.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/001-events.jsonl\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.status.json\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.progress.jsonl\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/004-verify.stdout.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/003-implementor.stdout.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/004-verify.stderr.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/streams/003-implementor.stderr.log\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/003-implementor.json\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/004-verify.status.json\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/003-implementor.progress.jsonl\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/004-verify.progress.jsonl\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/00-foundation/progress/003-implementor.status.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
